# CI

This repo has **one** npm CI job (`.github/workflows/ci.yml`): `npm ci`, `npm audit --audit-level=high`, `npm test`, portal build, `bash scripts/package-spa.sh`.

- Keep `scripts/package-spa.sh` packaging `site/index.html` (not the Next.js BFF).
- Do not add AWS apply, Lambda zip, or extra deploy workflows here. Publish already lives in `.github/workflows/publish.yml`.
- Pin GitHub Action SHAs. Do not add `--no-verify` or skip hooks.

```yaml
# BAD — second AWS job in this repo
- run: terraform apply

# GOOD — stay on the npm + SPA package path
- run: bash scripts/package-spa.sh
```
